  "closed_findings": [
    {
      "id": "B5",
      "classification": "BLOCKER_CLOSED",
      "evidence": "runP1PostV22 is now only the outer pilot.WithRecoveryRouting callback. The entire config/DB/inspector/precheck/recovery/dispatcher body is inside runP1PostV22Routed, so canonical routing is installed before any journaled read, using the same router for the later dispatcher. The helper grants no storage authority and clears only process test/fixture routing when it returns.",
      "real_PG_proof": "External application_test uses the existing test-only planDatabase/occupancyFixture bridge, explicitly clears global routing, then observes original routing failure, zero loopback wire and start/cost transaction rollback. It next invokes the actual pilot.WithRecoveryRouting helper used by P1 and verifies one successful real SDK read plus persisted start/observation/cost."
    },
    {
      "id": "B6",
      "classification": "BLOCKER_CLOSED",
      "evidence": "Start/Observe errors are multi-wrapped with ErrStorageUnknown and the exact original cause. inspectionError returns the matched wrapped input, preserving the error chain through the real MinIO SDK. Both errors.Is(category) and errors.Is(original) plus original message are asserted by the enhanced SDK unit test.",
      "independent_old_new_counterexample": "Correctly mapped old86 storage source overlay fails original-cause assertion; unchanged current test with current storage source passes."
    }
  ],
